{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06075","headline":"上张令公 · 王维","name":"上张令公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珥笔趋丹陛，垂璫上玉除。\n步檐青琐闼，方幰画轮车。\n市阅千金字，朝闻五色书。\n致君光帝典，荐士满公车。\n伏奏回金驾，横经重石渠。\n从兹罢角觝，且复幸储胥。\n天统知尧後，王章笑鲁初。\n匈奴遥俯伏，汉相俨簪裾。\n贾生非不遇，汲黯自堪疎。\n学易思求我，言诗或起予。\n当从大夫後，何惜隶人余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}